{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Space Grunts: Chrono Shard</strong> is a high-octane blend of tactical depth and arcade energy. With the power of the Chrono Shard, you don't just survive the void, you master it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/b1f521d06674ae9aab7c2e33db94b335.poster.avif?t=1771863473\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/b1f521d06674ae9aab7c2e33db94b335.webm?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/b1f521d06674ae9aab7c2e33db94b335.mp4?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The Chrono Loop</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your Shard to rewind the clock. Any items you\u2019ve placed or changes you\u2019ve made to the environment stay exactly where they are for your next attempt. Learn from the past to conquer the future.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Rapid-Fire Strategy </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget slow-paced menus. This is the <strong>original Space Grunts speed.</strong> Fast-paced, turn-based combat that rewards quick thinking and even quicker trigger fingers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/89d2ed3d3eb89df11699f0cea6b527fd.poster.avif?t=1771863473\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/89d2ed3d3eb89df11699f0cea6b527fd.webm?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/89d2ed3d3eb89df11699f0cea6b527fd.mp4?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Engaging Crafting System </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of your loadout. Find crafting stations to <strong>disassemble loot</strong>, scavenge resources, and upgrade your weapons into unstoppable tools of destruction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/d3da5bae25e6ecad63315d790b5a514d.poster.avif?t=1771863473\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/d3da5bae25e6ecad63315d790b5a514d.webm?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/d3da5bae25e6ecad63315d790b5a514d.mp4?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evolutionary Skill Trees</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong> </strong>Shape your playstyle. Invest in three core skill types to unlock specialized sub-classes. Whether you become a <strong>Sniper, Assassin, Hitman, Hardened, Elite, Engineer,</strong> <strong>Gadget, Gearhead,</strong> or <strong>Veteran</strong>, your build defines your edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/461a2b287f6bd7866edb7774611a5598.poster.avif?t=1771863473\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/461a2b287f6bd7866edb7774611a5598.webm?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/461a2b287f6bd7866edb7774611a5598.mp4?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Kinetic Combat</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every shot counts. Use unique weapon spread patterns and <strong>explosive shockwaves</strong> to physically manipulate the battlefield, launching enemies into hazards or clearing your path to the HyperGate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/cbe50b161574d11f3ee62ea548a92d42.poster.avif?t=1771863473\" width=1170 height=488 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/cbe50b161574d11f3ee62ea548a92d42.webm?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/cbe50b161574d11f3ee62ea548a92d42.mp4?t=1771863473\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Deep Space Hazards</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy into <strong>procedurally generated</strong> space stations and moon bases. Every mission is a new layout of mysterious sectors and deadly surprises.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Secure the Gates</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sentient Ooze is devouring the galaxy, jumping through a hijacked network of <strong>HyperGates</strong>. As part of the Space Grunts\u2019 elite tactical unit, you are dropped into &quot;time bubbles&quot; to shut down the gates and contain the spread.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate <strong>procedurally generated</strong> space stations and moon bases where every mission is a new layout of mysterious sectors and deadly surprises. Loop the timeline, evolve your grunt, and stop the Ooze\u2014at any cost.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Persistent Time-Loops:</strong> Carry over items and environmental changes between runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elite Sub-Classes:</strong> Level up your skills to unlock unique benefits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Advanced Crafting:</strong> Create, upgrade, and scrap gear at specialized stations.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Signature Fast-Paced Gameplay:</strong> The classic Space Grunts arcade feel in a turn-based format.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Universe:</strong> Infinite missions across stations, moon bases, and deep space.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/extras/a7278a391b6b5f59be3e20585a70489e.avif?t=1771863473\" width=1200 height=240 /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3403540?t=1771863473","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/e83cb7278f0affdfb4cd2339a2cc2894c67d41ba/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771863473","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/46ae155d4eb067e3de434ae4760944a1273b7f12/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771863473","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3403540/46ae155d4eb067e3de434ae4760944a1273b7f12/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771863473","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":34814